  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing words: God''s self-designation, which Moses is to tell Israel sent him.', 'Exodus 3:14', 'God said to Moses, ''I AM WHO I AM,'' and he said, ''You shall tell the children of Israel this: "I AM has sent me to you."''', 'WEB', 2,
